<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Pemex details Q1 sales, export income.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Pemex details Q1 sales, export income.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's oil and gas monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) reported its domestic and export sales for the first three months of the year. Figures are in millions of dollars.</p>
<p>    Item		    Q1 1996		  Q1 1997</p>
<p>  Total			 7,221		    9,172</p>
<p>  Domestic Sales*	   4,762		    6,261</p>
<p>    Oil Products	    3,934		    5,233</p>
<p>    Natural Gas		 329			526</p>
<p>    Chemicals		   499			501</p>
<p>  Export Sales		2,459		    2,912</p>
<p>    Crude Oil		 2,292		    2,679</p>
<p>    Oil Products		 48			 60</p>
<p>    Natural Gas		   8			 16</p>
<p>    Chemicals		   111			156</p>
<p>Legend: Statement is unaudited, * gross sales at consumer prices, includes indirect taxes</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728 7903)).</p>
</text>
